# First Horde wolf from Ogunaro Wolfrunner (the Valley of Honor).
# Sources: Forever client 1.60.1.70338 tables via wago.tools (ItemSparse: level,
# price, races, riding spell; SkillLineAbility: Riding); npcs.json and
# items.json for the trainer, the vendor and its stock.
# Forever riding: the client files every racial riding spell under one Riding
# skill (SkillLineAbility), so any riding trainer of your faction teaches it:
# Apprentice Riding (skill 75) from level 40, Journeyman Riding (150) at 60.
# Blizzard: learning to ride grants a mount, and training costs 100g at 40 and
# 1,000g at 60 (Kris Zierhut). ItemSparse lists the
# mounts at 20g (level 40) and 200g (level 60), usable by every race of the
# faction; whether a vendor still wants Exalted with another race's city (the
# Era rule) is server-side and unconfirmed.

step Learn to ride
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Kildar and Ogunaro Wolfrunner's kennel are in Orgrimmar's Valley of Honor. At 40 Kildar teaches Riding (100g per Blizzard's designers), and learning it gives you a mount. The Forever client lets every Horde race ride these.
  level 40
  train 4752                          -- Kildar, riding trainer
  skill Riding 75

step Pick a colour
  tip Ogunaro Wolfrunner sells the other colours (20g each in the Forever client). Buy any you want, or none if the mount you were given is the one you like.
  vendor 3362                         -- Ogunaro Wolfrunner
  buy 1132 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Timber Wolf, 20g
  buy 5665 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Dire Wolf, 20g
  buy 5668 npc 3362 optional          -- Horn of the Brown Wolf, 20g
  note Horn of the Black Wolf is in the client (20g) but our data has no vendor selling it.
